   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Perfect Crossing - Playing a Big Game</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sport has the power to change the world. This phrase by Nelson Mandela indicates the power of transformation of sport. In our institution, sport is a tool for education. In this way, we use sports, education and culture as instruments for the integral formation of children and adolescents in situations of socioeconomic vulnerability. The goal is to promote social leadership and develop different SDGs in order to impact the community in which they live.</narrative>
  </description>
